{"id":"pt_text_manyo_001_yamabe","title_original":"万葉集・山部赤人「田児の浦ゆ」","title_ja":"山部赤人「田児の浦ゆ」","author_name_display":"山部赤人","era_year":730,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"田児の浦ゆ うち出でて見れば 真白にそ\n富士の高嶺に 雪は降りける","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集_(西本願寺本)/卷第三","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_manyo_otomo_tabito","title_original":"万葉集・大伴旅人「験なきものを思はずは」","title_ja":"大伴旅人「験なきものを思はずは」","author_name_display":"大伴旅人","era_year":730,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"験なき ものを思はずは 一杯の\n濁れる酒を 飲むべくあるらし","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集_(西本願寺本)/卷第三","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
