{"id":"pt_text_manyo_takechi_kurohito","title_original":"万葉集・高市黒人「いずくにか我は宿らむ」","title_ja":"高市黒人「いずくにか我は宿らむ」","author_name_display":"高市黒人","era_year":700,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"いずくにか 我は宿らむ 高島の\n勝野の原に この日暮れなば","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集_(西本願寺本)/卷第三","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_kokin_kanajo","title_original":"古今和歌集 仮名序","title_ja":"古今和歌集 仮名序「やまと歌は人の心を種として」","author_name_display":"紀貫之","era_year":905,"era_period":"平安","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"歌論","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"やまと歌は、人の心を種として、よろづの言の葉とぞなれりける。","excerpt_note":"古今和歌集 仮名序冒頭","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/古今和歌集/仮名序","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1,"concept_links":[{"concept_id":"cp_verse_language","link_type":"分析対象"}]},
{"id":"pt_text_shinkokin_saigyo_kokoro","title_original":"新古今和歌集・西行「心なき身にも」","title_ja":"西行「心なき身にもあはれは知られけり」","author_name_display":"西行","era_year":1180,"era_period":"中世","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"心なき 身にもあはれは 知られけり\n鴫立つ沢の 秋の夕暮れ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/新古今和歌集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shinkokin_teika_miwataseba","title_original":"新古今和歌集・定家「見渡せば花も紅葉もなかりけり」","title_ja":"藤原定家「見渡せば花も紅葉もなかりけり」","author_name_display":"藤原定家","era_year":1205,"era_period":"中世","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"見渡せば 花も紅葉も なかりけり\n浦の苫屋の 秋の夕暮れ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/新古今和歌集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
