{"id":"pt_text_shinkokin_jien_oki2","title_original":"新古今和歌集・慈円「世の中よ道こそなけれ」","title_ja":"慈円「世の中よ道こそなけれ思ひ入る」","author_name_display":"慈円","era_year":1205,"era_period":"中世","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"世の中よ 道こそなけれ 思ひ入る\n山の奥にも 鹿ぞ鳴くなる","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/新古今和歌集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":2},
