{"id":"pt_text_hakushu_himawari","title_original":"北原白秋『邪宗門』「邪宗門秘曲」","title_ja":"北原白秋「邪宗門秘曲」冒頭","author_name_display":"北原白秋","era_year":1909,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"われは思ふ、末世の邪宗、切支丹でうすの魔法。\n黒船の加比丹を、紅毛の不可思議国を","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000106/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_sakutaro_aoneko","title_original":"萩原朔太郎『青猫』「青猫」","title_ja":"萩原朔太郎「青猫」","author_name_display":"萩原朔太郎","era_year":1923,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"この美しい都会を愛するのはよいことだ\nこの美しい都会の建築を愛するのはよいことだ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000067/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_kotaro_doutei","title_original":"高村光太郎『道程』「道程」","title_ja":"高村光太郎「道程」","author_name_display":"高村光太郎","era_year":1914,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"僕の前に道はない\n僕の後ろに道は出来る","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001168/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chuya_yogoreta_alt","title_original":"中原中也「サーカス」","title_ja":"中原中也「サーカス」","author_name_display":"中原中也","era_year":1929,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"幾時代かがありまして\n茶色い戦争ありました\n幾時代かがありまして\n冬は疾風吹きました","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000026/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_kenji_haru","title_original":"宮沢賢治「春と修羅」","title_ja":"宮沢賢治「春と修羅」（序）","author_name_display":"宮沢賢治","era_year":1924,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"わたくしといふ現象は\n仮定された有機交流電燈の\nひとつの青い照明です","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000081/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_misuzu_kokoro","title_original":"金子みすゞ「こだまでしょうか」","title_ja":"金子みすゞ「こだまでしょうか」","author_name_display":"金子みすゞ","era_year":1925,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"童謡","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"「遊ぼう」っていうと\n「遊ぼう」っていう。\n「ばか」っていうと\n「ばか」っていう。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001157/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dohi_arima","title_original":"土井晩翠『天地有情』「荒城の月」","title_ja":"土井晩翠「荒城の月」","author_name_display":"土井晩翠","era_year":1898,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"新体詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"春高楼の花の宴\n巡る盃影さして\n千代の松ヶ枝わけ出でし\n昔の光今いずこ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000041/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},

{"id":"pt_text_shimazaki_chikuma","title_original":"島崎藤村『若菜集』「初恋」","title_ja":"島崎藤村「初恋」","author_name_display":"島崎藤村","era_year":1896,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"新体詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"まだあげ初めし前髪の\n林檎のもとに見えしとき\n前にさしたる花櫛の\n花ある君と思ひけり","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000158/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},

{"id":"pt_text_dhammapada_277_279","title_original":"धम्मपद २७७-२७९","title_ja":"法句経 277-279偈（諸行無常）","author_name_display":"（仏典）","era_year":-300,"era_period":"原始仏教","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"pli","form_genre":"ガーター","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"sabbe saṅkhārā aniccāti, yadā paññāya passati;\natha nibbindati dukkhe, esa maggo visuddhiyā","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.tipitaka.org/romn/cscd/s0502m.mul0.xml","source_archive":"Tipitaka.org","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_theragatha_1","title_original":"Theragāthā 1","title_ja":"テーラガーター（長老偈）冒頭","author_name_display":"（伝・上座部）","era_year":-200,"era_period":"原始仏教","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"pli","form_genre":"ガーター","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"「Sukhumacchikajālā vā ahimassa pāmojjatā;\ntvaṃ pi ānanda dhīraṃ na santāpehi」","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.tipitaka.org/","source_archive":"Tipitaka.org","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_kanzan_2","title_original":"寒山詩「人問寒山道」","title_ja":"寒山詩「人問寒山道」","author_name_display":"寒山","era_year":750,"era_period":"唐","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩・禅偈","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"人問寒山道，寒山路不通。\n夏天冰未釋，日出霧朦朧。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/寒山詩","source_archive":"維基文庫 / CBETA","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xiaochong_jiehui","title_original":"證道歌（永嘉玄覺）","title_ja":"永嘉玄覚 証道歌（冒頭）","author_name_display":"永嘉玄覚","era_year":700,"era_period":"唐","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"禅詩偈","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"君不見、絕學無為閑道人，\n不除妄想不求真。\n無明實性即佛性，幻化空身即法身。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/證道歌","source_archive":"CBETA","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dogen_genjokoan","title_original":"道元『正法眼蔵』現成公案","title_ja":"道元「現成公案」冒頭","author_name_display":"道元","era_year":1233,"era_period":"鎌倉","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"禅文・偈","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"諸法の仏法なる時節、すなはち迷悟あり、修行あり、生あり、死あり、諸仏あり、衆生あり。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001329/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_lotus_gathaka","title_original":"妙法蓮華経 偈頌 序品","title_ja":"妙法蓮華経 序品 偈頌","author_name_display":"（伝・鳩摩羅什訳）","era_year":406,"era_period":"後秦訳経期","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"偈頌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"爾時佛放眉間白毫相光，照東方萬八千世界，靡不周遍。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.cbeta.org/","source_archive":"CBETA","canonical_tier":2},

{"id":"pt_text_rigveda_1_154","title_original":"ऋग्वेद १.१५४","title_ja":"リグ・ヴェーダ 1.154 ヴィシュヌ讃歌","author_name_display":"（伝）Dīrghatamas","era_year":-1200,"era_period":"ヴェーダ期","culture_region":"サンスクリット","language_original":"san","form_genre":"讃歌","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"विष्णोर्नु कं वीर्याणि प्र वोचं यः पार्थिवानि विममे रजांसि।\nयो अस्कभायदुत्तरं सधस्थं विचक्रमाणस्त्रेधोरुगायः॥","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/corpustei/transformations/html/sa_RV.htm","source_archive":"GRETIL","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_atharvaveda_5_2","title_original":"अथर्ववेद ५.२","title_ja":"アタルヴァ・ヴェーダ 5.2","author_name_display":"（伝）","era_year":-900,"era_period":"ヴェーダ後期","culture_region":"サンスクリット","language_original":"san","form_genre":"讃歌・呪文","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"रात्रिं प्र पदे कं सदस्थं भुवनस्य पतिः कनिष्ठः।","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/","source_archive":"GRETIL","canonical_tier":3},
{"id":"pt_text_kalidasa_kumara","title_original":"कालिदास, कुमारसम्भव I.1","title_ja":"カーリダーサ『クマーラサンバヴァ』第1巻冒頭","author_name_display":"Kalidasa","era_year":400,"era_period":"古典サンスクリット","culture_region":"サンスクリット","language_original":"san","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"अस्त्युत्तरस्यां दिशि देवतात्मा हिमालयो नाम नगाधिराजः।\nपूर्वापरौ तोयनिधी वगाह्य स्थितः पृथिव्या इव मानदण्डः॥","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/corpustei/transformations/html/sa_kAlidAsa-kumArasaMbhava.htm","source_archive":"GRETIL","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_kalidasa_raghuvamsa","title_original":"कालिदास, रघुवंश I.1","title_ja":"カーリダーサ『ラグヴァンシャ』冒頭","author_name_display":"Kalidasa","era_year":400,"era_period":"古典サンスクリット","culture_region":"サンスクリット","language_original":"san","form_genre":"叙事詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"वागर्थाविव सम्पृक्तौ वागर्थप्रतिपत्तये।\nजगतः पितरौ वन्दे पार्वतीपरमेश्वरौ॥","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/corpustei/transformations/html/sa_kAlidAsa-raghuvaMza.htm","source_archive":"GRETIL","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_amaru_shataka","title_original":"अमरुशतक १","title_ja":"アマル『百頌』第1番","author_name_display":"Amaru","era_year":700,"era_period":"古典サンスクリット","culture_region":"サンスクリット","language_original":"san","form_genre":"恋愛短詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"शंभुस्वयंभुहरयो हरिणेक्षणानां येनाक्रियन्त सततं गृहकुम्भदासाः","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/","source_archive":"GRETIL","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_jayadeva_2","title_original":"जयदेव, गीतगोविन्द II","title_ja":"ジャヤデーヴァ『ギータ・ゴーヴィンダ』第2歌","author_name_display":"Jayadeva","era_year":1180,"era_period":"古典サンスクリット","culture_region":"サンスクリット","language_original":"san","form_genre":"歌唱叙情詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"वसन्ते वासन्तीकुसुमसुकुमारैरवयवै-र्भ्रमन्तीमारामे","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"http://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/","source_archive":"GRETIL","canonical_tier":1},
