{"id":"pt_text_zuhayr_muallaqa","title_original":"معلقة زهير","title_ja":"ズハイル・イブン・アビー・スルマーのムアッラカ","author_name_display":"Zuhayr ibn Abi Sulma","era_year":600,"era_period":"Pre-Islamic Arabic","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"ara","form_genre":"カスィーダ","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"أَمِنْ أُمِّ أَوْفَى دِمْنَةٌ لَمْ تَكَلَّمِ\nبِحَوْمَانَةِ الدُرَّاجِ فَالْمُتَثَلَّمِ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ar.wikisource.org/wiki/معلقة_زهير_بن_أبي_سلمى","source_archive":"Wikisource ar","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_labid_muallaqa","title_original":"معلقة لبيد","title_ja":"ラビード・イブン・ラビーアのムアッラカ","author_name_display":"Labid","era_year":620,"era_period":"Pre-Islamic Arabic","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"ara","form_genre":"カスィーダ","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"عَفَتِ الدِّيارُ مَحَلُّها فَمُقامُها\nبِمِنىً تَأَبَّدَ غَوْلُها فَرِجامُها","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ar.wikisource.org/wiki/معلقة_لبيد_بن_ربيعة","source_archive":"Wikisource ar","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_amr_ibn_kulthum","title_original":"معلقة عمرو بن كلثوم","title_ja":"アムル・イブン・クルスームのムアッラカ","author_name_display":"Amr ibn Kulthum","era_year":580,"era_period":"Pre-Islamic Arabic","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"ara","form_genre":"カスィーダ","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"أَلا هُبّي بِصَحنِكِ فَاصبَحينا\nوَلا تُبقي خُمورَ الأَندَرينا","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ar.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"Wikisource ar","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_al_hansa_marathiya","title_original":"الخنساء، رثاء صخر","title_ja":"ハンサー「兄サフルへの哀悼」","author_name_display":"Al-Khansa","era_year":645,"era_period":"アラビア初期","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"ara","form_genre":"哀悼詩（マルスィーヤ）","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"يا صَخرُ ما لِعَيني تَبكي إِذا غَفَلَت\nوَتَستَهِلُّ إِذا ما هَجَّتِ الذِكَرُ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ar.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"Wikisource ar","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ibn_arabi_tarjuman","title_original":"ابن عربي، ترجمان الأشواق","title_ja":"イブン＝アラビー『欲求の翻訳者』","author_name_display":"Ibn Arabi","era_year":1215,"era_period":"アンダルシア","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"ara","form_genre":"スーフィー詩","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"لقد صار قلبي قابلاً كل صورةٍ\nفمرعى لغزلانٍ وديرٌ لرهبانِ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ar.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"Wikisource ar","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ibn_zaydun_nuniyya","title_original":"ابن زيدون، النونية","title_ja":"イブン・ザイドゥーン「ヌーニーヤ」","author_name_display":"Ibn Zaydun","era_year":1060,"era_period":"アンダルシア","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"ara","form_genre":"カスィーダ","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"أضحى التنائي بديلاً من تدانينا\nوناب عن طيب لقيانا تجافينا","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ar.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"Wikisource ar","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_hafez_ghazal_3","title_original":"حافظ، غزل ۳","title_ja":"ハーフィズ ガザル第3番","author_name_display":"Hafez","era_year":1370,"era_period":"Persian classical","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"fas","form_genre":"ガザル","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"اگر آن ترک شیرازی به دست آرد دل ما را\nبه خال هندویش بخشم سمرقند و بخارا را","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ganjoor.net/hafez/ghazal/sh3","source_archive":"Ganjoor","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_hafez_ghazal_94","title_original":"حافظ، غزل ۹۴","title_ja":"ハーフィズ ガザル第94番「ヨセフは戻る」","author_name_display":"Hafez","era_year":1370,"era_period":"Persian classical","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"fas","form_genre":"ガザル","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"یوسف گمگشته باز آید به کنعان غم مخور\nکلبه احزان شود روزی گلستان غم مخور","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ganjoor.net/hafez/ghazal/sh94","source_archive":"Ganjoor","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_rumi_ghazal_1","title_original":"مولوی، غزل","title_ja":"ルーミー ガザル「我らはどこに行こうか」","author_name_display":"Rumi","era_year":1260,"era_period":"Persian classical","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"fas","form_genre":"ガザル","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"بنمای رخ که باغ و گلستانم آرزوست\nبگشای لب که قند فراوانم آرزوست","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ganjoor.net/moulavi/shams","source_archive":"Ganjoor","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_saadi_bustan","title_original":"سعدی، بوستان","title_ja":"サアディー『ブースタン』冒頭","author_name_display":"Saadi","era_year":1257,"era_period":"Persian classical","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"fas","form_genre":"マスナヴィー","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"به نام خدایی که جان آفرید\nسخن گفتن اندر زبان آفرید","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ganjoor.net/saadi/boostan","source_archive":"Ganjoor","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_jami_yusuf","title_original":"جامی، یوسف و زلیخا","title_ja":"ジャーミー『ユーセフとズライハー』","author_name_display":"Jami","era_year":1480,"era_period":"Persian classical","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"fas","form_genre":"マスナヴィー","length_lines":2,"full_text_or_excerpt":"الهی غنچه امید بگشا\nگلی از روضه جاوید بنما","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ganjoor.net/jami","source_archive":"Ganjoor","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_omar_khayyam_2","title_original":"خیام، رباعی","title_ja":"ハイヤーム ルバーイー「明日の心配は」","author_name_display":"Omar Khayyam","era_year":1110,"era_period":"Persian classical","culture_region":"アラビア・ペルシア","language_original":"fas","form_genre":"ルバーイー","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"از دی که گذشت هیچ ازو یاد مکن\nفردا که نیامده است فریاد مکن","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ganjoor.net/khayyam","source_archive":"Ganjoor","canonical_tier":1}
